msgid "You made it!"
msgstr "{crew|¡Lo has conseguido!|¡Lo has conseguido!|¡Lo habéis conseguido!}"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You reached {place} before the pirates! The people of {place} chase the pirates away, and give you"
" {silver} silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|¡Has llegado|¡Has llegado|¡Habéis llegado} a {place} antes que los piratas! La gente de "
"{place} echa a los piratas y {crew|te da|te da|os da} {silver} {silver|moneda|monedas} de plata."

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Caught!"
msgstr "{crew|¡Atrapado!|¡Atrapada!|¡Atrapados!|¡Atrapadas!}"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pirates caught you! They laugh, kiss the prow of your boat, and sail away. Try again?"
msgstr ""
"¡Los piratas {crew|te han|te han|os han} atrapado! Se ríen, besan la proa de {crew|tu|tu|vuestro} "
"barco y se van navegando. ¿Otra vez?"

