#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The traders weigh their silver on small scales: a broken piece of a bracelet buys as much as a "
"coin of the same weight."
msgstr ""
"Los comerciantes pesan la plata en pequeñas balanzas: un trozo de pulsera roto vale lo mismo que "
"una moneda del mismo peso."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The combs of antler are so precious that people are buried with them."
msgstr "Los peines de asta son tan valiosos que a la gente la entierran con ellos."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings make their sails of wool; it takes a weaver a whole year to weave a big one."
msgstr "Los vikingos hacen sus velas de lana; una tejedora tarda un año entero en tejer una grande."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey is the only sweet the vikings know, so the bees are worth a lot."
msgstr "La miel es el único dulce que conocen los vikingos, por eso las abejas valen mucho."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The runes are carved in straight lines, so that they are easy to cut in wood and stone."
msgstr "Las runas se tallan en líneas rectas, para que sea fácil cortarlas en madera y piedra."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "In winter, the lakes freeze, and people travel on skates made of horse bones."
msgstr "En invierno, los lagos se hielan, y la gente viaja con patines hechos de huesos de caballo."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Women hold the keys of the house: a woman with keys on her belt runs the farm."
msgstr ""
"Las mujeres guardan las llaves de la casa: una mujer con llaves en el cinturón dirige la granja."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings give their boats names, like Long Serpent or Sea Horse."
msgstr "Los vikingos ponen nombre a sus barcos, como Serpiente Larga o Caballo de Mar."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cats on the farms catch the mice in the grain stores, so everybody loves them."
msgstr "Los gatos de las granjas cazan los ratones del granero, por eso todos los quieren."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good horse is worth more than a whole boatload of fish."
msgstr "Un buen caballo vale más que un barco entero lleno de pescado."

