#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A good trader asks before she sells. Hail three boats on the lakes and ask about the price of "
"wool. Then sell a crate of wool where it pays."
msgstr ""
"Un buen comerciante pregunta antes de vender. {crew|Saluda|Saluda|Saludad} a tres barcos en los "
"lagos y {crew|pregunta|pregunta|preguntad} por el precio de la lana. Luego "
"{crew|vende|vende|vended} una caja de lana donde más paguen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now you know more than most traders! Sell your wool where they want it."
msgstr ""
"¡Ahora {crew|sabes|sabes|sabéis} más que muchos comerciantes! {crew|Vende|Vende|Vended} "
"{crew|tu|tu|vuestra} lana donde la quieran."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool? They always need it at the weaver in Guldvik."
msgstr "¿Lana? En casa de la tejedora de Guldvik siempre la necesitan."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The market in Kråkhamn buys wool too, they say."
msgstr "Dicen que el mercado de Kråkhamn también compra lana."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good soft wool! I will spin it into yarn and weave it into cloth. Thank you."
msgstr "¡Qué lana tan suave! La hilaré y la tejeré para hacer tela. Gracias."

