#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/011_the_lambs_in_the_cold_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A late frost tonight, and my ewes had their lambs today! Bring two warm blankets from Sæunn in "
"Guldvik, and a jug of milk from the horse farm, before the night falls."
msgstr ""
"¡Esta noche hiela, y hoy mis ovejas han tenido corderos! {crew|Trae|Trae|Traed} dos mantas "
"calentitas de Sæunn, en Guldvik, y una jarra de leche de la granja de caballos, antes de que caiga"
" la noche."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/011_the_lambs_in_the_cold_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My thickest wool blankets. Wrap the little ones well!"
msgstr "Mis mantas de lana más gruesas. ¡{crew|Envuelve|Envuelve|Envolved} bien a los pequeños!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/011_the_lambs_in_the_cold_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Warm milk for the lambs. Row fast, so it stays warm!"
msgstr "Leche caliente para los corderos. ¡{crew|Rema|Rema|Remad} rápido, para que no se enfríe!"

