msgid "The Sick Calf"
msgstr "La ternera enferma"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The calf of our cow does not drink. Tova says she needs chamomile and a warm stone in her bed. The"
" chamomile is with Tova, the stones are hot in Dagny's kiln on Bergö."
msgstr ""
"La ternerita de nuestra vaca no bebe. Tova dice que necesita manzanilla y una piedra caliente en "
"su cama. La manzanilla la tiene Tova; las piedras se calientan en el horno de Dagny, en Bergö."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Chamomile calms her tummy. Give it with warm water."
msgstr "La manzanilla le calma la tripa. {crew|Dásela|Dásela|Dádsela} con agua tibia."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/015_the_sick_calf/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hot from the kiln, wrapped in wool. It stays warm all night."
msgstr "Recién sacada del horno y envuelta en lana. Se mantiene caliente toda la noche."

