#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/026_clay_for_the_potter/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My island has no clay left! The best clay is on the shore of Ekvik. Bring me four baskets, and you"
" get two crates of my pots."
msgstr ""
"¡En mi isla ya no queda barro! El mejor barro está en la orilla de Ekvik. "
"{crew|Tráeme|Tráeme|Traedme} cuatro cestas, y {crew|te doy|te doy|os doy} dos cajas de mis "
"vasijas."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/026_clay_for_the_potter/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grey, sticky clay from the shore. Heavy too!"
msgstr "Barro gris y pegajoso de la orilla. ¡Y pesa mucho!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/026_clay_for_the_potter/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lovely clay! Squeeze it, smell it... Here are your pots, still warm from the kiln."
