#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees for Solby"
msgstr "Abejas para Solby"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My apple trees bloom, but no bee visits them! Without bees, no apples. Buy a beehive from Alfhild "
"in Dimmberga and bring it to my orchard."
msgstr ""
"¡Mis manzanos están en flor, pero ninguna abeja los visita! Sin abejas no hay manzanas. "
"{crew|Compra|Compra|Comprad} una colmena a Alfhild, en Dimmberga, y {crew|tráela|tráela|traedla} a"
" mi huerto."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Listen to them hum! Now the flowers will become apples. Take these flowers for your farm."
msgstr ""
"¡{crew|Escucha|Escucha|Escuchad} cómo zumban! Ahora las flores se convertirán en manzanas. "
"{crew|Llévate|Llévate|Llevaos} estas flores para {crew|tu|tu|vuestra} granja."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees carry the pollen from flower to flower, so that the fruits grow."
msgstr "Las abejas llevan el polen de flor en flor, para que crezcan los frutos."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Lost Lamb"
msgstr "El cordero perdido"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of the lambs from the cold night is gone! The little one with the black ear. Ask Freya and "
"Liv, they paddle everywhere in their canoe."
msgstr ""
"¡Falta uno de los corderos de la noche fría! El pequeño de la oreja negra. "
"{crew|Pregunta|Pregunta|Preguntad} a Freya y Liv: van en su canoa a todas partes."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A lamb with a black ear? We saw one on Laxön, eating Tova's flowers!"
msgstr "¿Una corderita con una oreja negra? ¡Vimos una en Laxön, comiéndose las flores de Tova!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She swam over! Can you imagine? She is wet but well. Take her home."
msgstr ""
"¡Ha venido nadando! ¿Te lo puedes creer? Está mojada pero bien. {crew|Llévala|Llévala|Llevadla} a "
"casa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Black Ear! She runs to her mother. Keep the other lamb of that ewe: she likes you."
msgstr ""
"¡Oreja Negra! Corre hacia su madre. {crew|Quédate|Quédate|Quedaos} con el otro cordero de esa "
"oveja: le {crew|caes|caes|caéis} bien."

