#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Healers dried herbs in bundles under the roof, to have them all winter."
msgstr ""
"Las curanderas secaban las hierbas en manojos bajo el tejado, para tenerlas todo el invierno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Mill Turns"
msgstr "El molino gira"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The harvest is in, and the mill wheel turns day and night! But the farmers are slow. Bring me six "
"crates of grain to grind."
msgstr ""
"La cosecha está recogida, ¡y la rueda del molino gira día y noche! Pero los granjeros son lentos. "
"{crew|Tráeme|Tráeme|Traedme} seis cajas de grano para moler."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six crates! Listen to the stones grind. Bjarne says hello, and here is your share."
msgstr ""
"¡Seis cajas! {crew|Escucha|Escucha|Escuchad} cómo muelen las piedras. Bjarne {crew|te|te|os} manda"
" saludos, y aquí {crew|tienes tu|tienes tu|tenéis vuestra} parte."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Most vikings ground their grain by hand with two stones; a water mill was a wonder."
msgstr ""
"Casi todos los vikingos molían el grano a mano con dos piedras; un molino de agua era una "
"maravilla."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Henhouse Full"
msgstr "Un gallinero lleno"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eggs sell so well! Let us have six hens. Buy hens at the market in Kråkhamn or the farm of "
"Frosttorp, and bring them home."
msgstr ""
"¡Los huevos se venden muy bien! Tengamos seis gallinas. {crew|Compra|Compra|Comprad} gallinas en "
"el mercado de Kråkhamn o en la granja de Frosttorp, y {crew|tráelas|tráelas|traedlas} a casa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six hens! Cluck, cluck, scratch, scratch. Do not forget: they eat grain."
msgstr "¡Seis gallinas! Clo, clo, rasca, rasca. No {crew|olvides|olvides|olvidéis}: comen grano."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking hens were small and laid fewer eggs than ours, but every farm had some."
msgstr ""
"Las gallinas vikingas eran pequeñas y ponían menos huevos que las nuestras, pero todas las granjas"
" tenían algunas."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey Cakes"
msgstr "Pasteles de miel"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We want to sell honey cakes on the market! But we have no oven. Bring honey and grain to your "
"grandmother; she bakes them overnight, and you bring us the cakes."
msgstr ""
"¡Queremos vender pasteles de miel en el mercado! Pero no tenemos horno. {crew|Lleva|Lleva|Llevad} "
"miel y grano a {crew|tu|tu|vuestra} abuela; ella los hornea por la noche, y {crew|tú nos traes|tú "
"nos traes|vosotros nos traéis|vosotras nos traéis} los pasteles."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey! Now the grain."
msgstr "¡Miel! Ahora el grano."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I bake them tonight. Come for them in the morning!"
msgstr "Los hornearé esta noche. ¡{crew|Ven|Ven|Venid} a por ellos por la mañana!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Still warm. Do not eat them all on the way!"
msgstr "Todavía calientes. ¡No {crew|te los comas|te los comas|os los comáis} todos por el camino!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They smell so good! Everybody comes to our stall. Here, half the silver is yours."
msgstr ""
"¡Huelen tan bien! Todo el mundo viene a nuestro puesto. {crew|Toma|Toma|Tomad}, la mitad de la "
"plata es {crew|tuya|tuya|vuestra}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cakes"
