#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Chieftain's Feast"
msgstr "La fiesta del jefe"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Thora turns twelve! A feast with the whole valley: bring me three crates of mead and "
"two of cheese, within three days."
msgstr ""
"¡Mi hija Thora cumple doce años! Una fiesta con todo el valle: {crew|tráeme|tráeme|traedme} tres "
"cajas de hidromiel y dos de queso, en tres días."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The mead! The skalds will sing."
msgstr "¡El hidromiel! Los escaldos cantarán."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese, mead, songs and a fire! Come in, sit by me: it is the best birthday ever."
msgstr ""
"¡Queso, hidromiel, canciones y fuego! {crew|Entra, siéntate|Entra, siéntate|Entrad, sentaos} a mi "
"lado: es el mejor cumpleaños de mi vida."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A chieftain's hall had a long fire in the middle, and benches along the walls."
msgstr "La sala de un jefe tenía un fuego largo en el centro y bancos a lo largo de las paredes."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ferryman's Tale"
msgstr "El cuento del barquero"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard told a story here last night: a hidden cove, where the swans of the lakes are born. He"
" says: ask the potter, the miller and the old man of Svanetorp."
msgstr ""
"Anoche el viejo Halvard contó aquí una historia: una cala escondida donde nacen los cisnes de los "
"lagos. Dice: {crew|pregunta|pregunta|preguntad} a la alfarera, a la molinera y al viejo de "
"Svanetorp."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cove? My grandmother said: it lies where the reeds grow tallest. Ask Astrid."
msgstr ""
"¿La cala? Mi abuela decía: está donde los juncos crecen más altos. "
"{crew|Pregunta|Pregunta|Preguntad} a Astrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reeds? The tallest ones grow south, by Svanetorp. Go to Grim."
msgstr "¿Juncos? Los más altos crecen al sur, junto a Svanetorp. {crew|Ve|Ve|Id} a ver a Grim."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So you found my secret. Behind my farm, in the reeds: the swan cove. Look, the cygnets! Grey and "
"fluffy. Tell no one!"
msgstr ""
"Así que {crew|has encontrado|has encontrado|habéis encontrado} mi secreto. Detrás de mi granja, "
"entre los juncos: la cala de los cisnes. {crew|Mira|Mira|Mirad}, ¡los polluelos! Grises y "
"esponjosos. ¡No se lo {crew|digas|digas|digáis} a nadie!"

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
