#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Messenger's Cold"
msgstr "El resfriado de Inga"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Atchoo! I have a cold, and I must tell the smith, the horse farm and the herders about the autumn "
"feast at Hallvik. Can you do it today? Atchoo!"
msgstr ""
"¡Achís! Estoy resfriada, y tengo que avisar al herrero, a la granja de caballos y a los pastores "
"de la fiesta de otoño en Hallvik. ¿{crew|Puedes|Puedes|Podéis} hacerlo hoy? ¡Achís!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The autumn feast? I will bring my best knives to show."
msgstr "¿La fiesta de otoño? Llevaré mis mejores cuchillos para enseñarlos."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We will come with all the horses! Tell Inga to drink hot honey water."
msgstr ""
"¡Iremos con todos los caballos! {crew|Dile|Dile|Decidle} a Inga que beba agua caliente con miel."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast! I will bring my flute. Thank you!"
msgstr "¡Una fiesta! Llevaré mi flauta. ¡Gracias!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Messengers rowed, rode and ran: news could cross a land in a few days."
msgstr ""
"Los mensajeros remaban, cabalgaban y corrían: una noticia podía cruzar un país en pocos días."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for Frosttorp"
msgstr "Heno para Frosttorp"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hay meadow was flooded, and the cows are hungry! I need eight crates of hay. Your big boat can "
"do it in one trip."
msgstr ""
"¡Mi prado de heno se ha inundado, y las vacas tienen hambre! Necesito ocho cajas de heno. "
"{crew|Tu|Tu|Vuestro} barco grande puede hacerlo en un viaje."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Moo! Listen to them, they are happy. You saved my winter. Take this cheese."
msgstr ""
"¡Muuu! {crew|Escúchalas|Escúchalas|Escuchadlas}, están contentas. {crew|Has salvado|Has "
"salvado|Habéis salvado} mi invierno. {crew|Toma|Toma|Tomad} este queso."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay is dried grass; without enough of it, a farm could not keep its animals over winter."
msgstr ""
"El heno es hierba seca; sin bastante heno, una granja no podía mantener a sus animales en "
"invierno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sigvor's Cheese"
msgstr "El queso de Sigvor"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My goats gave so much milk this summer! I made four big wheels of cheese for Orm's autumn feast in"
" Hallvik, but my boat is full of goats. Will you carry them?"
msgstr ""
"¡Mis cabras han dado mucha leche este verano! He hecho cuatro quesos grandes para la fiesta de "
"otoño de Orm, en Hallvik, pero mi barco está lleno de cabras. ¿{crew|Los llevas|Los llevas|Los "
"lleváis} {crew|tú|tú|vosotros|vosotras}?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sigvor's cheese! The guests will fight over it. Well, not fight: they will ask nicely."
msgstr ""
"¡El queso de Sigvor! Los invitados se pelearán por él. Bueno, pelear no: lo pedirán por favor."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Roll them in gently. And no nibbling!"
msgstr "{crew|Mételos|Mételos|Metedlos} rodando con cuidado. ¡Y nada de mordisquear!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr "Queso"

#. a thing of a task; {count|...|...} picks the form for the number {count} (one, then the others;
