"¡Cuac! ¡Cuac! {crew|Sujétate el gorro, chico|Sujétate el gorro, chica|Sujetaos los gorros, "
"chicos|Sujetaos los gorros, chicas}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
