"En las granjas vikingas tenían gansos por los huevos, las plumas y el plumón para las almohadas."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Runestone"
msgstr "La piedra rúnica"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I will raise a runestone for my mother. The stone comes from the quarry by Bergö, and the "
"runecarver needs iron chisels from the smith. The stone is so big, it takes three crates of room!"
msgstr ""
"Voy a levantar una piedra rúnica para mi madre. La piedra viene de la cantera de Bergö, y el "
"tallador de runas necesita cinceles de hierro del herrero. ¡La piedra es tan grande que ocupa tres"
" cajas!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good chisels. Now the stone."
msgstr "Buenos cinceles. Ahora la piedra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The stone! The carver begins today."
msgstr "¡La piedra! El tallador empieza hoy."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is in three pieces, to fit in your boat. The carver joins them."
msgstr "Está en tres trozos, para que quepa en {crew|tu|tu|vuestro} barco. El tallador los unirá."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The runestone stands! It says: Eirik raised this stone for Gunnvor, his good mother. And at the "
"bottom, small: Ylva and Sigrid rowed it."
msgstr ""
"¡La piedra rúnica ya está en pie! Dice: Eirik levantó esta piedra por Gunnvor, su buena madre. Y "
"abajo, en pequeño: la trajeron remando Ylva y Sigrid."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Stone"
msgstr "Piedra"

