#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats climb anything: rocks, roofs, and sometimes boats."
msgstr "Las cabras se suben a todo: rocas, tejados y, a veces, barcos."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley in Spring"
msgstr "Cebada en primavera"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fields are dry: time to sow! Plant barley, and while it grows, sell two crates of eggs to Orm "
"in Hallvik to buy more seed."
msgstr ""
"Los campos están secos: ¡hora de sembrar! {crew|Siembra|Siembra|Sembrad} cebada, y mientras crece,"
" {crew|vende|vende|vended} dos cajas de huevos a Orm, en Hallvik, para comprar más semilla."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The barley is sown. Now the sun and the rain do the work."
msgstr "La cebada está sembrada. Ahora el sol y la lluvia hacen el trabajo."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eggs! I make my famous egg cake. Here, good silver for good eggs."
msgstr ""
"¡Huevos! Haré mi famoso pastel de huevo. {crew|Toma|Toma|Tomad}, buena plata por buenos huevos."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley was the most important grain of the north: for bread, porridge and ale."
msgstr "La cebada era el grano más importante del norte: para pan, gachas y cerveza."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Great Hold"
msgstr "La gran bodega"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now we make your boat great! Ten planks from Frosttorp, three crates of tools, and 30 silver. Then"
" she takes two more crates. Ten planks are more than you can carry at once."
msgstr ""
"¡Ahora haremos grande {crew|tu|tu|vuestro} barco! Diez tablas de Frosttorp, tres cajas de "
"herramientas y 30 monedas de plata. Así cabrán dos cajas más. Diez tablas son más de las que "
"{crew|puedes|puedes|podéis} llevar de una vez."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks again? Bjarne is building you a ship!"
msgstr "¿Tablas otra vez? ¡Bjarne {crew|te|te|os} está construyendo un barco!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Iron for the rivets. Now my wages."
msgstr "Hierro para los remaches. Ahora mi paga."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two more crates! And go and see Signe in Ekvik: she builds real ships, and my crates go with you "
"into any of them."
msgstr ""
"¡Dos cajas más! Y {crew|ve|ve|id} a ver a Signe, en Ekvik: construye barcos de verdad, y el sitio "
"de más que {crew|te|te|os} he hecho vale en cualquiera de ellos."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A knarr, the cargo ship of the vikings, could carry the load of twenty boats."
msgstr "Un knarr, el barco de carga de los vikingos, podía llevar la carga de veinte botes."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's Salt Run"
msgstr "La sal de Bjørn"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My boat leaks, and the fishers of Ekvik wait for salt! Take eight sacks for me from here to Ekvik."
" Your new hold is just right."
msgstr ""
"¡Mi barco hace agua, y los pescadores de Ekvik esperan la sal! {crew|Lleva|Lleva|Llevad} por mí "
"ocho sacos de aquí a Ekvik. {crew|Tu|Tu|Vuestra} bodega nueva es justo lo que hace falta."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's salt, brought by you? Then I pay you, not him. Ha!"
msgstr ""
"¿La sal de Bjørn, y {crew|la traes tú|la traes tú|la traéis vosotros|la traéis vosotras}? Entonces"
" {crew|te|te|os} pago a {crew|ti|ti|vosotros|vosotras}, no a él. ¡Ja!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eight sacks of the best salt from the sea. Keep them dry!"
msgstr "Ocho sacos de la mejor sal del mar. ¡Que no se mojen!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
