msgid "The Swarm"
msgstr "El enjambre"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My bees swarmed! A whole cloud of them flew off with a young queen, and Solveig says they hang in "
"her apple tree. Bring them this empty hive, and bring them back to me."
msgstr ""
"¡Mis abejas se han ido en enjambre! Una nube entera se fue volando con una reina joven, y Solveig "
"dice que cuelgan de su manzano. {crew|Llévales|Llévales|Llevadles} esta colmena vacía, y "
"{crew|tráemelas|tráemelas|traédmelas} de vuelta."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They hang there like a big brown pear! Hold the hive under them... shake... they are in!"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuelgan ahí como una gran pera marrón! {crew|Pon|Pon|Poned} la colmena debajo... una sacudida... "
"¡ya están dentro!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My bees! Not one sting for you? Then they like you. Take two crates of honey."
msgstr ""
"¡Mis abejas! ¿Ni una picadura? Entonces {crew|les caes|les caes|les caéis} bien. "
"{crew|Llévate|Llévate|Llevaos} dos cajas de miel."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Row smoothly: a swarm is calm, as long as nobody bumps the hive."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Rema|Rema|Remad} con suavidad: un enjambre está tranquilo mientras nadie golpee la colmena."

