#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hunters go north for the whole summer. They need dried fish: six crates. Bring them within "
"three days, before they leave."
msgstr ""
"Mis cazadores se van al norte todo el verano. Necesitan pescado seco: seis cajas. "
"{crew|Tráelas|Tráelas|Traedlas} en tres días, antes de que se marchen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Six crates! The hunters say: this fish tastes better than the bear meat. Ha! Here is your silver."
msgstr ""
"¡Seis cajas! Los cazadores dicen: este pescado está más rico que la carne de oso. ¡Ja! Aquí "
"{crew|tienes tu|tienes tu|tenéis vuestra} plata."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dried fish kept for years, and was the bread of the travellers."
msgstr "El pescado seco duraba años, y era el pan de los viajeros."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
