#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Midsummer again! This year, all the boats row in a line with torches. Bring three crates of mead, "
"and four torches from Orm in Hallvik: your boat leads the line!"
msgstr ""
"¡Otra vez la fiesta del verano! Este año, todos los barcos reman en fila con antorchas. "
"{crew|Trae|Trae|Traed} tres cajas de hidromiel y cuatro antorchas de Orm, en Hallvik: "
"¡{crew|tu|tu|vuestro} barco va el primero!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead for after the procession. Now the torches."
msgstr "Hidromiel para después de la procesión. Ahora las antorchas."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My best tar torches, from the ones you helped me make!"
msgstr ""
"¡Mis mejores antorchas de brea, de las que {crew|me ayudaste|me ayudaste|me ayudasteis} a hacer!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Twenty boats in a line, and you in front, with the dragon head! The torches shine on the water. "
"The most beautiful night of the year."
msgstr ""
"¡Veinte barcos en fila, y {crew|tú|tú|vosotros|vosotras} delante, con la cabeza de dragón! Las "
"antorchas brillan sobre el agua. La noche más bonita del año."

