#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sunny Hill"
msgstr "La colina soleada"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My old aunt Gerd moves to Solby, to her sister. She owns the sunny hill by your farm, and says: "
"whoever rows me and my chests gets the hill! She has three chests."
msgstr ""
"Mi vieja tía Gerd se muda a Solby, con su hermana. Es la dueña de la colina soleada junto a "
"{crew|tu|tu|vuestra} granja, y dice: ¡quien me lleve remando con mis baúles se queda la colina! "
"Tiene tres baúles."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd's chests? Bring her too!"
msgstr "¿Los baúles de la tía Gerd? ¡{crew|Tráela|Tráela|Traedla} a ella también!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd: My chests! Careful, the blue one has my grandmother's spoons."
msgstr "La tía Gerd: ¡Mis baúles! Cuidado, en el azul están las cucharas de mi abuela."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My sister! And my chests! You are good girls. The sunny hill is yours: plant something beautiful "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"¡Mi hermana! ¡Y mis baúles! {crew|Eres un buen chico|Eres una buena chica|Sois buenos chicos|Sois "
"buenas chicas}. La colina soleada es {crew|tuya|tuya|vuestra}: {crew|planta|planta|plantad} algo "
"bonito en ella."

