#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sunny hill has the best grass. Let us have a real flock: five sheep! Buy them at the market or"
" from Sten's herders."
msgstr ""
"La colina soleada tiene la mejor hierba. Tengamos un rebaño de verdad: ¡cinco ovejas! "
"{crew|Cómpralas|Cómpralas|Compradlas} en el mercado o a los pastores de Sten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Five sheep on the hill, like white clouds. We will have wool for the whole family!"
msgstr "Cinco ovejas en la colina, como nubes blancas. ¡Tendremos lana para toda la familia!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sheep gave wool, milk, meat and skins; nothing was wasted."
msgstr "Las ovejas daban lana, leche, carne y pieles; no se desperdiciaba nada."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Bear Comes Back"
msgstr "Vuelve el oso"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Honey is missing again! But this time, the paw prints are BIG. Ask Inga the messenger, she rows "
"past the woods every day."
msgstr ""
"¡Vuelve a faltar miel! Pero esta vez las huellas son GRANDES. {crew|Pregunta|Pregunta|Preguntad} a"
" Inga la mensajera: pasa remando junto al bosque cada día."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A young bear by the woods of Hjortingsala, with a white spot on his chest. The cub you carried, "
"all grown up!"
msgstr ""
"Un oso joven junto al bosque de Hjortingsala, con una mancha blanca en el pecho. ¡El osezno que "
"{crew|llevaste|llevaste|llevasteis}, ya mayor!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I put the pots by the old oak. Look! He comes out of the bushes and sniffs. He remembers you!"
msgstr ""
"He puesto los tarros junto al roble viejo. ¡{crew|Mira|Mira|Mirad}! Sale de los arbustos y "
"olfatea. ¡Se acuerda de {crew|ti|ti|vosotros|vosotras}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then he gets honey of his own, far from my hives. Take him two pots."
msgstr ""
"Entonces tendrá su propia miel, lejos de mis colmenas. {crew|Llévale|Llévale|Llevadle} dos tarros."

