#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Both inns ran dry at the same time! Six barrels for Gudrun in Vargvik and six for Orm in Hallvik. "
"With twelve crates of room, you can do it in one trip!"
msgstr ""
"¡Las dos posadas se han quedado sin cerveza a la vez! Seis barriles para Gudrun, en Vargvik, y "
"seis para Orm, en Hallvik. Con sitio para doce cajas, ¡{crew|puedes|puedes|podéis} hacerlo en un "
"viaje!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
