#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Winter Stores"
msgstr "Provisiones de invierno"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn again! Before the lakes freeze, fill the store: ten crates of hay and six of grain, within "
"three days. You know how by now!"
msgstr ""
"¡Otra vez otoño! Antes de que se hielen los lagos, {crew|llena|llena|llenad} el almacén: diez "
"cajas de heno y seis de grano, en tres días. ¡Ya {crew|sabes|sabes|sabéis} cómo!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for all our animals. Now the grain."
msgstr "Heno para todos nuestros animales. Ahora el grano."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full to the roof! Not one animal will be hungry this winter."
msgstr "¡El almacén está lleno hasta el techo! Ningún animal pasará hambre este invierno."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn was the busiest time: everything for the long winter had to be in."
msgstr "El otoño era la época de más trabajo: había que tenerlo todo listo para el largo invierno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for Every Farm"
msgstr "Pescado para cada granja"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our best catch ever! Bring three bundles of dried fish to each farm: Frosttorp, Solby and "
"Svanetorp. A gift from Stormvik, for the winter."
msgstr ""
"¡Nuestra mejor pesca! {crew|Lleva|Lleva|Llevad} tres manojos de pescado seco a cada granja: "
"Frosttorp, Solby y Svanetorp. Un regalo de Stormvik, para el invierno."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "From Tor? What a neighbour!"
msgstr "¿De Tor? ¡Qué buen vecino!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for the winter! Tell Tor: apples for him in spring."
msgstr "¡Pescado para el invierno! {crew|Dile|Dile|Decidle} a Tor: en primavera tendrá manzanas."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish? For an old man? Tor is a good boy. Thank you!"
msgstr "¿Pescado? ¿Para un viejo? Tor es un buen chico. ¡Gracias!"

