#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Neighbours gave each other food before winter; the gift came back another year."
msgstr "Los vecinos se regalaban comida antes del invierno; el regalo volvía otro año."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "Invitaciones"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We hold a feast here on the farm, for all our friends! Invite them: hail three boats on the lakes,"
" and visit Tova and Ragnfrid."
msgstr ""
"¡Hacemos una fiesta aquí en la granja, para todos nuestros amigos! "
"{crew|Invítalos|Invítalos|Invitadlos}: {crew|saluda|saluda|saludad} a tres barcos en los lagos, y "
"{crew|visita|visita|visitad} a Tova y a Ragnfrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast? Of course! I will tell everybody on the lakes."
msgstr "¿Una fiesta? ¡Claro! Se lo diré a todo el mundo en los lagos."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast at your farm? We come, and bring our fiddle!"
msgstr "¿Una fiesta en {crew|tu|tu|vuestra} granja? ¡Iremos, y llevaremos nuestro violín!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Count on me! I bring my best fish."
msgstr "¡{crew|Cuenta|Cuenta|Contad} conmigo! Llevaré mi mejor pescado."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I would not miss it! I come with my herb wine."
msgstr "¡No me lo perdería! Iré con mi vino de hierbas."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We come with all the horses! Silke wants to see her daughter."
msgstr "¡Iremos con todos los caballos! Silke quiere ver a su hija."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A great feast could last a week, with guests from every farm around."
msgstr "Una gran fiesta podía durar una semana, con invitados de todas las granjas de alrededor."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Food for the Feast"
msgstr "Comida para la fiesta"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many guests! Bring four crates of mead, four of ale and four of cheese. Twelve crates: your big"
" boat can do it, but you must buy well."
msgstr ""
"¡Cuántos invitados! {crew|Trae|Trae|Traed} cuatro cajas de hidromiel, cuatro de cerveza y cuatro "
"de queso. Doce cajas: {crew|tu|tu|vuestro} barco grande puede, pero {crew|tienes|tienes|tenéis} "
"que comprar bien."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the ale."
msgstr "¡Hidromiel! Ahora la cerveza."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! Now the cheese."
msgstr "¡Cerveza! Ahora el queso."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everything is ready: the tables, the torches, the food. Now only the guests!"
msgstr "Todo está listo: las mesas, las antorchas, la comida. ¡Ya solo faltan los invitados!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At a feast, the host gave the best food and drink: being generous brought honour."
msgstr "En una fiesta, el anfitrión daba la mejor comida y bebida: ser generoso traía honor."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Feast at the Farm"
msgstr "La fiesta en la granja"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The guests come! But some have no boat: bring Old Grim from Svanetorp, Old Halvard from Solby, and"
" Tova from her island. Then the feast begins!"
msgstr ""
"¡Llegan los invitados! Pero algunos no tienen barco: {crew|trae|trae|traed} al viejo Grim de "
"Svanetorp, al viejo Halvard de Solby y a Tova de su isla. ¡Luego empieza la fiesta!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, Grim!"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido, Grim!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast for an old man? I bring my cow's best butter!"
msgstr "¿Una fiesta para un viejo? ¡Llevo la mejor mantequilla de mi vaca!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, Halvard!"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido, Halvard!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "One more trip with my favourite skippers! Did I tell you about the sea serpent?"
msgstr ""
"¡Un viaje más con {crew|mi patrón favorito|mi patrona favorita|mis patrones favoritos|mis patronas"
" favoritas}! ¿{crew|Te he contado|Te he contado|Os he contado} lo de la serpiente de mar?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My apprentices, healers now, and rowing me to a feast. I am proud of you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Mi aprendiz, ya curandero, me lleva|Mi aprendiz, ya curandera, me lleva|Mis aprendices, ya "
"curanderos, me llevan|Mis aprendices, ya curanderas, me llevan} remando a una fiesta. Estoy "
"{crew|orgullosa de ti|orgullosa de ti|orgullosa de vosotros|orgullosa de vosotras}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everybody is here: the people and the animals of all the lakes, music and torches and songs. Look "
"what you made of an old boat, three hens and a sheep."
msgstr ""
"Aquí está todo el mundo: la gente y los animales de todos los lagos, música, antorchas y "
"canciones. {crew|Mira lo que has hecho|Mira lo que has hecho|Mirad lo que habéis hecho} con un "
"bote viejo, tres gallinas y una oveja."

